# Skills placement

**Global skills and subagents** live in `~/.agents/skills/` and `~/.agents/agents/` (also mirrored under `~/.cursor/`). Do not copy them into this repository.

**Project-specific skills** belong under `.agents/skills/<skill-name>/` (e.g. `.agents/skills/beads/SKILL.md`). Project rules live in `.agents/rules/`.

**Client adapters** symlink to `.agents/` — no per-tool copies:

```bash
.cursor/skills  -> ../.agents/skills
.cursor/rules   -> ../.agents/rules
.codex/skills   -> ../.agents/skills
.claude/skills  -> ../.agents/skills
```

Subagents are loaded from the global install only (`~/.agents/agents/`). This repo does not ship `.cursor/agents/` or `.codex/agents/`.

Example for a new project skill `foo`:

```bash
mkdir -p .agents/skills/foo
# create .agents/skills/foo/SKILL.md
# client skill directories already point at .agents/skills
```
